    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The stunningly handsome, Crossdressing Detective Ye Yuyan is actually an expert in solving crime cases!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444610/extras/4ef47f6db867fa40eeb8965abeb9e988.avif?t=1719500106\" /></span><br>Welcome to this action infiltration game, where you'll play as the protagonist Ye Yuyan, an expert detective with an impressive appearance, skilled in both male and female disguises. Utilize her unique abilities to infiltrate the strongholds of criminal organizations, rescue missing girls, and continue the search for her missing sister.<br><br>The game features various types of missions, including investigation tasks, rescue missions, and elimination missions, each testing your wit and courage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444610/extras/c6431d9eab116f43dda7077385f9d314.avif?t=1719500106\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What mysterious events will Ye Yuyan experience? What dangerous criminals will she encounter?</h2><br>In &quot;Crossdressing Detective Ye Yuyan,&quot; you'll immerse yourself in a city rampant with crime, engaging in intellectual battles with various criminals and villains. You'll need to gather evidence, analyze information, and pursue the truth from every angle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444610/extras/cf6e39f7839ec56a50373efd5b07324d.avif?t=1719500106\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the beautiful sister, rescue the missing girls!</h2><br>The main task of the protagonist Ye Yuyan is to find her missing sister. She may have been abducted or could be on a dangerous mission.<br><br>To gather information, players need to operate their phones to find various mission requests.<br><br><span 